---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
import Icon from '@/components/Icon.astro';
import { entries, entryUrl, dateLabel, readingTime } from '@/lib';
const posts=(await entries()).filter(p=>p.collection==='posts');
const pinned=posts.find(p=>p.data.pinned);
const regular=posts.filter(p=>p!==pinned);
const tags=[...new Set(posts.flatMap(p=>p.data.tags))].map(tag=>({tag,count:posts.filter(p=>p.data.tags.includes(tag)).length})).sort((a,b)=>b.count-a.count);
---
<Base title="文稿列表"><section class="posts-page replica-container" data-post-browser><div class="posts-grid"><div class="posts-main">
  <div class="posts-title"><span>BLOG</span><h1>文章</h1></div>
  {pinned&&<a class="pinned-post" href={entryUrl(pinned)} data-post-item data-tags={JSON.stringify(pinned.data.tags)} data-date={+pinned.data.date} data-updated={+(pinned.data.updated||pinned.data.date)}><span class="pinned-label">置顶</span><h2>{pinned.data.title}</h2><p>{pinned.data.description}</p><div class="post-meta"><time datetime={pinned.data.date.toISOString()}>{dateLabel(pinned.data.date)}</time><span>·</span><span>{pinned.data.category}</span></div><div class="pinned-foot"><Icon name="book" size={12}/><span>约 {readingTime(pinned.body)} 分钟阅读</span></div></a>}
  <div class="post-toolbar"><span data-post-count>共 {posts.length} 篇</span><div><span class="current-tag" data-current-tag hidden></span><button class="active" data-post-sort="newest" aria-pressed="true">最新</button><button data-post-sort="oldest" aria-pressed="false">最早</button><button data-post-sort="updated" aria-pressed="false">最近更新</button></div></div>
  <div class="mobile-post-tools"><button data-search-open><Icon name="search" size={14}/> 搜索</button><button data-tags-open># 全部标签</button></div>
  <div class="replica-post-list" data-post-list>{regular.map(post=><a class="replica-post" href={entryUrl(post)} data-post-item data-tags={JSON.stringify(post.data.tags)} data-date={+post.data.date} data-updated={+(post.data.updated||post.data.date)}><h2>{post.data.title}</h2><p>{post.data.description}</p><div class="post-meta"><time datetime={post.data.date.toISOString()}>{dateLabel(post.data.date)}</time><span>·</span><span>{post.data.category}</span><span>/</span><span>{post.data.tags.slice(0,3).join('，')}</span></div></a>)}</div>
  <div class="post-filter-empty" data-post-empty hidden><p>这个标签下还没有文稿。</p><a href="/posts/" data-post-tag="">查看全部文稿 →</a></div>
  <div class="replica-pagination"><p>文字未完，来日方长。</p></div>
</div><aside class="posts-sidebar"><div class="sidebar-search"><button data-search-open><Icon name="search" size={15}/> 搜索</button><div class="tag-cloud real-tag-cloud"><a href="/posts/" data-post-tag="" class="active">全部 <span>{posts.length}</span></a>{tags.slice(0,10).map(({tag,count})=><a href={`/posts/?tag=${encodeURIComponent(tag)}`} data-post-tag={tag}>{tag} <span>{count}</span></a>)}</div><button class="all-tags" data-tags-open>全部标签</button></div></aside></div></section></Base>
